{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792234500, "covers_from": "2026-10-17T10:55:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-17T10:56:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792234560, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-17T10:55:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49923, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "每月僅存4千元！北市生活成本全台最高　6成上班族今年沒加薪\n好累了好累好累", "display_name": "大安代表 No.49,923", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T10:55:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40523, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "市政", "content": "不要再浪費市民繳的稅蓋一些沒用的設施了", "display_name": "中山代表 No.40,523", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T10:55:18+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47631, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "北安路的車禍率太高。最近換工作到大直上班，一週去三天，三天都遇到汽機車車禍發生。建議汽機車分流", "display_name": "中山代表 Abby", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T10:55:33+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 57159, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的公車專用道，每次公車經過都會濺起水花把人噴得一身濕，而且基本上前後都會噴", "display_name": "中山代表 No.57,159", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T10:55:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3814, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "臺北市幾條公車路線改成所謂的幹線公車，比如說15路公車就變成和平幹線，對外國人辨識搭乘很不友善", "display_name": "信義代表 No.3,814", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 40523, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.40,523", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 47631, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 Abby", "district": "zhongsh